than being continually burdened due to having a strength of 5, or
leaving behind so many things that you can actually stay unburdened
at that strength.  You're only overtaxed for 10-16 turns or so, after
all.  As long as a dwarf, etc. isn't already on the level at the time,
a closet can keep you safe for that amount of time.



